IDD_THREEPOINTCIRCLEMFC_DIALOG DIALOGEX 0, 0, 540, 350
STYLE DS_SHELLFONT | WS_POPUP | WS_VISIBLE | WS_CAPTION | WS_SYSMENU | WS_MINIMIZEBOX
